# Overlay motion

Clock: `--overlay-duration` (450ms) in `packages/design-system/src/styles/tokens.css`. `--drawer-duration` aliases it. Tailwind class: `duration-overlay`. Hover stays `--motion-duration` / `duration-motion`.

CSS: `packages/design-system/src/styles/index.css`, keyed by `data-slot`. Not `components.json`. Not a Tailwind JS config. `tw-animate-css` is not installed — `animate-in` / `slide-in-from-*` do nothing.

## Feature files

Import `Drawer`, `Sheet`, `DropdownMenu`, `Tooltip`, `AlertDialog` from `@karon/design-system`. Do not add overlay keyframes, `animate-in`, or a second duration in `apps/clinic`.

## New overlay primitive

1. `shadcn add` into `packages/design-system`.
2. Strip `animate-in` / `slide-in-from-*`.
3. Set `data-slot` on overlay and content.
4. Add the enter/exit block next to the existing overlay rules. Popovers animate the CSS `scale` property, not `transform` (Radix positioning uses `transform`).

## Collapsed rail

Leave collision detection on. Never `avoidCollisions={false}`. Use `collisionPadding` so every menu item stays in the viewport.
